msgctxt "Route119_House_Text_RumorAboutCaveOfOrigin"
msgid ""
"I heard about a cave called the CAVE\n"
"OF ORIGIN.\p"
"People rumor that the spirits of\n"
"POKéMON are revived there. Could\l"
"something like that really happen?$"
